window.EXAUD={"Hoa is always polite when she talks to adults.": "audio/cau/30f664238e37dbc6.mp3", "Adults need about eight hours of sleep.": "audio/cau/965ef8331141619a.mp3", "You should book the tickets in advance.": "audio/cau/2bd6efcf0e107da4.mp3", "Mi bought her train ticket two weeks in advance.": "audio/cau/dc9e6758d13cdd7c.mp3", "One advantage of city life is good transport.": "audio/cau/9fc77e303de2b98e.mp3", "Living in the city has an advantage and a disadvantage.": "audio/cau/059e2e89f7212162.mp3", "The air in the countryside is fresh.": "audio/cau/c976ff78f2c2738c.mp3", "Open the window to let some fresh air in.": "audio/cau/d1639d8ab7bbcd46.mp3", "Noi Bai Airport is in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/282019109c12eb03.mp3", "We took a taxi to the airport to catch our plane.": "audio/cau/e094ed7f1a8da89a.mp3", "We must keep our traditional crafts alive.": "audio/cau/461c910cfd0f1264.mp3", "The old tree is still alive, but that one is dead.": "audio/cau/713514d344b69a38.mp3", "My parents allow me to play games at weekends.": "audio/cau/0e78db317452b06e.mp3", "The park doesn't allow bikes; it bans them.": "audio/cau/cf368ad5bb4a58ec.mp3", "Lan likes music. She also likes drawing.": "audio/cau/a42927a6760bdc56.mp3", "Nam speaks English and also learns Japanese.": "audio/cau/d657bddc45a35d0d.mp3", "My mother always gets up early.": "audio/cau/018f205f8d900a21.mp3", "Nam always does his homework, but he never watches TV late.": "audio/cau/bed514ec413923ae.mp3", "I am a student at Kim Dong School.": "audio/cau/7c9effe742362b92.mp3", "I am in Class 6A, and my friends are in 6B.": "audio/cau/69bce6abc68e1822.mp3", "I use an app to learn English.": "audio/cau/8b5de3a8ea891fe1.mp3", "Lan downloaded a new app; this application helps her book taxis.": "audio/cau/1b345290c5e399e1.mp3", "There are many useful apps for students.": "audio/cau/03ccde264f0438bc.mp3", "This app is free, but those apps are expensive.": "audio/cau/70732b1ff6e3364d.mp3", "Mi and Nam are in Class 6A.": "audio/cau/b0d165e52ca7dc85.mp3", "We are happy today, and Lan is happy too.": "audio/cau/9718e7702bade08e.mp3", "Let's arrange a meeting for Saturday.": "audio/cau/9e984057e78adf2b.mp3", "Mi arranged the books, and the arrangement looks neat.": "audio/cau/a8e9ee111743842c.mp3", "The arrival time of the train is 9 a.m.": "audio/cau/24e0098229460b82.mp3", "We waited for Nam's arrival, and he arrived at noon.": "audio/cau/13362e13e55490f5.mp3", "What time does the bus arrive at school?": "audio/cau/6222580dc0b6be13.mp3", "We arrived in Da Nang at night; our arrival was late.": "audio/cau/12e29a0ec6a17bbc.mp3", "Please pay attention to the teacher.": "audio/cau/9cbf379be0e4f13b.mp3", "Lan is an attentive student who pays attention in class.": "audio/cau/991bd7e8b14790af.mp3", "We should avoid travelling at rush hour.": "audio/cau/36eeabfcb706f602.mp3", "Some traffic jams are unavoidable, but we can avoid many of them.": "audio/cau/4c1850d58e22cd5f.mp3", "Steve Jobs passed away in 2011.": "audio/cau/be8b92331608f7f3.mp3", "My school is 2 km away from my house.": "audio/cau/36a79be5031eac35.mp3", "Look at picture b and answer.": "audio/cau/b2672a8a1898ddda.mp3", "Write the letter b next to the right answer.": "audio/cau/9ec7b58bf879e0bc.mp3", "Eating too much sugar is bad for your teeth.": "audio/cau/385b55508b3849c3.mp3", "The traffic was bad today, but yesterday it was worse.": "audio/cau/4db5861a9ee30736.mp3", "The city was badly affected by the flood.": "audio/cau/1e256308778b183a.mp3", "Nam played badly today, but yesterday he played worse.": "audio/cau/c2078c45e0d95aa8.mp3", "My school bag is very heavy.": "audio/cau/81c86f54e6817fa3.mp3", "Mi has a red bag, and Lan has two blue bags.": "audio/cau/33eb6b7417d04199.mp3", "Please use cloth bags instead of plastic bags.": "audio/cau/6e414fb5f6866be5.mp3", "This bag is old, so Mum bought two new bags.": "audio/cau/5c197b55387c41e0.mp3", "Please be quiet in the library.": "audio/cau/d6fab02a2655be4e.mp3", "I want to be a doctor. My sister is a nurse.": "audio/cau/e31166f3ca032296.mp3", "Our lessons begin at seven o'clock.": "audio/cau/7e2700abcf553879.mp3", "The film began at 8 p.m. and finished at 10 p.m.": "audio/cau/27d24f5e96b08bae.mp3", "I ride my bicycle to school every day.": "audio/cau/dcdb6e0b40d1db18.mp3", "Nam's bicycle is new, and he loves his bike.": "audio/cau/11b6650e5706243d.mp3", "Our school has a big garden.": "audio/cau/6b86817f41024790.mp3", "My house is big, but Minh's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/1d7d2b8d19284673.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is bigger than Da Nang.": "audio/cau/5efe9fe286047142.mp3", "My house is big, but Nam's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/44f8b6366001f6da.mp3", "This is the biggest market in the city.": "audio/cau/ba6358ef44b7b295.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is the biggest city in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/815c69dda42327e1.mp3", "Lan rides her bike to school.": "audio/cau/80133585ffee2230.mp3", "My bike is old, so Dad bought me a new bicycle.": "audio/cau/24ad75c6338c2de3.mp3", "Many students ride bikes to school.": "audio/cau/d465f6c242f32ec4.mp3", "My bike is blue, and my friends' bikes are red.": "audio/cau/c3cd23ea2efb7340.mp3", "I'm a bit tired today.": "audio/cau/42f3919d01ac7e5d.mp3", "Phong is a bit shy, but a little more confident now.": "audio/cau/8a006479d73a2609.mp3", "She wrote a book about her life.": "audio/cau/428afa8d58f841a3.mp3", "Lan reads a book every week, so she has many books.": "audio/cau/5a4070779479f823.mp3", "The film was long and boring.": "audio/cau/2fb37c98bad76a4f.mp3", "The lesson was boring, so Nam felt bored.": "audio/cau/0b9b11807d964d8b.mp3", "Please bring your English book tomorrow.": "audio/cau/cd49561735d6690b.mp3", "Exams can bring about a lot of stress.": "audio/cau/4bcd1f108e558b55.mp3", "I go to school by bus.": "audio/cau/95f45bf1658e850f.mp3", "Lan takes the bus because the buses are cheap.": "audio/cau/362c3212b1a0dbc6.mp3", "The buses are crowded in the morning.": "audio/cau/4fa37117ae1e3e0c.mp3", "This bus is new, but the other buses are old.": "audio/cau/f4d42669f06842ed.mp3", "Her family runs a small business in Hue.": "audio/cau/5535eee598660a8f.mp3", "He started a business and now he is a businessman.": "audio/cau/0fd271a26ee50825.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is a bustling city.": "audio/cau/3597bb53664f0dd1.mp3", "The market is bustling, but my street is quiet.": "audio/cau/f2c456603c67155d.mp3", "My mum is always busy at weekends.": "audio/cau/e860f8923617b0aa.mp3", "Hoa is busy today, but she is free tomorrow.": "audio/cau/1d5a0a62fb11072c.mp3", "The correct answer is c.": "audio/cau/115cc222c2d7fb6e.mp3", "Look at picture c and describe the girl.": "audio/cau/a211a53ea5c1cc24.mp3", "Mi can swim very well.": "audio/cau/3e8edac082144330.mp3", "I can ride a bike now, but last year I couldn't.": "audio/cau/af33705bbc26781d.mp3", "I use a bus card to go to school.": "audio/cau/65f0041022b0d5bc.mp3", "Hoa made a card for her friend's birthday.": "audio/cau/72d00c704e5dd8d1.mp3", "Old people in my village need special care.": "audio/cau/e2b32589dc4d57eb.mp3", "Lan takes care of her little brother very carefully.": "audio/cau/0449e85740a5edad.mp3", "Be careful when you cross the road.": "audio/cau/7d44eca76d25a07d.mp3", "Nam is careful, so he writes carefully.": "audio/cau/3961f897eee5f47e.mp3", "My grandmother is kind and caring.": "audio/cau/a03423bedfa41d41.mp3", "Hoa is caring. She takes care of her little sister.": "audio/cau/7cc44adf2286a858.mp3", "They carried out a study about city life.": "audio/cau/741e882cd91f0aed.mp3", "The old buses carried many passengers.": "audio/cau/1d29e18f669abb89.mp3", "Can you help me carry this box?": "audio/cau/a0f121aef5c03fe7.mp3", "Lan carried her books, and today she carries her bag.": "audio/cau/e736c67580379245.mp3", "We use the possessive case to show who owns something: Mi's bag.": "audio/cau/3276a3613027350f.mp3", "My pencil case is on the desk.": "audio/cau/777c125591c7b388.mp3", "I often chat with my neighbours.": "audio/cau/f9bdc10e4250f241.mp3", "Mi and Lan had a long chat after school.": "audio/cau/92771962baaa6db3.mp3", "Bus tickets are cheap in my city.": "audio/cau/03544a8cd417b99f.mp3", "This bike is cheaper than that expensive one.": "audio/cau/e0b002a616298d3f.mp3", "She has three children and two grandchildren.": "audio/cau/41e17d5597e264f0.mp3", "One child was quiet, but the other children were noisy.": "audio/cau/863bff50c6e9f303.mp3", "Choose the correct answer.": "audio/cau/9bb3b69b3f099527.mp3", "Mi chose a red pen. It was a good choice.": "audio/cau/4fabb83c5ec962f5.mp3", "I chose the bus because it is cheap.": "audio/cau/9c85ffa2fb7223db.mp3", "You can choose one, and Nam chose the red one.": "audio/cau/3684e06d8810f79f.mp3", "Big cities often have traffic jams.": "audio/cau/290573a9de9b8727.mp3", "Ha Noi is a city, and Hue is a city too.": "audio/cau/723b5f4c4ced8460.mp3", "I live in a big city.": "audio/cau/66e0022bec290560.mp3", "Life in the city is busier than in the countryside.": "audio/cau/ec0678a3bad99639.mp3", "Nam is my new classmate.": "audio/cau/8f038868644223fc.mp3", "My classmate and I sit in the same classroom.": "audio/cau/ebc5ea3d6e23a8ba.mp3", "Minh is a clever boy.": "audio/cau/620f8c5f3017a282.mp3", "Lan is clever. She answers the questions cleverly.": "audio/cau/2720a9ae3428f690.mp3", "Close your lips, then open them to say /b/.": "audio/cau/1c12f29d1557a6a6.mp3", "Please close the window; it's cold.": "audio/cau/20e2820b500dbcb2.mp3", "I came down with a cold last week.": "audio/cau/6589d8d2056f15e9.mp3", "It is cold in Ha Noi in winter.": "audio/cau/6af5e5587fe6cf7a.mp3", "Complete the sentences with the words.": "audio/cau/a10abe8427f587a5.mp3", "Mi completed her homework. Now it is complete.": "audio/cau/e89d49e3a54806e8.mp3", "Lan completely forgot her friend's birthday.": "audio/cau/ae968fd2ecb01b87.mp3", "Minh completely forgot about his homework.": "audio/cau/4ec9cda7a9209eb1.mp3", "Nam plans his time well to ensure timely completion of his project.": "audio/cau/dc9f46bca5bd24cf.mp3", "After the completion of the test, Hoa felt relaxed.": "audio/cau/8159d955f47b0ba3.mp3", "Lan concentrates on the most urgent task first.": "audio/cau/921a7ff233827ef2.mp3", "Minh can't concentrate when his phone is on.": "audio/cau/d4e473339e819b15.mp3", "The roads are congested at rush hour.": "audio/cau/f9d4d494bff4553f.mp3", "Congested streets cause traffic congestion every day.": "audio/cau/87781468c8c7ac85.mp3", "Traffic congestion is a big problem in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/ee78c5ee3b5db92c.mp3", "The streets are congested, so congestion makes us late.": "audio/cau/22360b232671b312.mp3", "The bus is a convenient way to travel.": "audio/cau/fee2bbafef431ce5.mp3", "City life is convenient, but village life is inconvenient.": "audio/cau/9a72816486a030b9.mp3", "Listen to the conversation and answer.": "audio/cau/9f48e7934c974946.mp3", "Mi had a short chat, not a long conversation.": "audio/cau/e32ab06f1cea65e6.mp3", "Practise the conversations with your partner.": "audio/cau/1d30e8173711a087.mp3", "Each conversation is short, so the conversations are easy.": "audio/cau/1993b4c73be239ce.mp3", "Life in the countryside is peaceful.": "audio/cau/95479ebba178019f.mp3", "The city is noisy, but the countryside is quiet.": "audio/cau/37f198fe8e1a722b.mp3", "Lan creates a to-do list every Sunday evening.": "audio/cau/87a26e3235a8f368.mp3", "Our class created a poster about healthy living.": "audio/cau/97dc8c8a67b315e5.mp3", "Hoa is very creative in art class.": "audio/cau/d1a85d15ebb2ea7b.mp3", "Nam is creative. He likes to create new games.": "audio/cau/a92d851d2aed43a0.mp3", "Art lessons help students show their creativity.": "audio/cau/ef2eb572bc331261.mp3", "Phong is creative, and his creativity makes our class fun.": "audio/cau/c91d4b0dff266adb.mp3", "The market is very crowded at weekends.": "audio/cau/5f5083d37f44058f.mp3", "There was a big crowd, so the bus was crowded.": "audio/cau/75a57d4b9263cc0e.mp3", "I cycle to school every day.": "audio/cau/1131e233c7995091.mp3", "Hoa is a good cyclist, and she can cycle very fast.": "audio/cau/77372027f155fac8.mp3", "My dad is a doctor.": "audio/cau/87de43de098d8ab6.mp3", "My dad cooks dinner, and my mum washes the dishes.": "audio/cau/8ca0dad82745ad96.mp3", "What's the date today?": "audio/cau/f9acf49dde1eb179.mp3", "Write the date of your birthday here.": "audio/cau/47f2ac3fb4653f20.mp3", "Can you describe your house?": "audio/cau/a0d5ad73f19e51bc.mp3", "Describe your friend and read your description to the class.": "audio/cau/5e8b000dcde9e11f.mp3", "Write a short description of your friend.": "audio/cau/1d3f9d3cf060662c.mp3", "Phong describes his school, and his description is funny.": "audio/cau/9801d95651b1cda6.mp3", "Read the descriptions and guess the person.": "audio/cau/20055a561b18e782.mp3", "Mi can describe people well, and her descriptions are fun.": "audio/cau/84984e9d66cc50f9.mp3", "I did my homework last night.": "audio/cau/52c1dc6ad84a16a5.mp3", "Did you do the project? Yes, I did.": "audio/cau/ce2a17ba3a5d2ade.mp3", "My house is different from yours.": "audio/cau/5abda8894fc87510.mp3", "Lan and Mi are different; the difference is their hobbies.": "audio/cau/fd7e006914631783.mp3", "Maths is difficult for me.": "audio/cau/16bb57fb47e5df02.mp3", "This test is difficult, but that one is easy.": "audio/cau/56b22511f0d64b7c.mp3", "The shop gives students a ten per cent discount.": "audio/cau/d385edaa0cd76e69.mp3", "With the discount, this bag is not expensive.": "audio/cau/9a29320c52ccf380.mp3", "I dislike noisy and crowded places.": "audio/cau/5ace2bb2616bf75c.mp3", "Mi likes cats, but she dislikes dogs.": "audio/cau/a21ccd81f7c8d400.mp3", "I do my homework after dinner.": "audio/cau/dfa2558950305f83.mp3", "Phong did his homework, and now it is done.": "audio/cau/4e496982963ec9df.mp3", "Does Lan like ice cream?": "audio/cau/15298c934c7dedf6.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but he doesn't watch TV.": "audio/cau/16100881d98fba74.mp3", "Mi doesn't like milk very much.": "audio/cau/63a58b0dc618ef2d.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but Minh doesn't do it.": "audio/cau/362bb11ca0696388.mp3", "I don't like rainy days.": "audio/cau/111328217b7f4b84.mp3", "We don't play games, but Minh does.": "audio/cau/851ce9fc9da85e82.mp3", "I have done my homework.": "audio/cau/319d28fa8d112271.mp3", "Nam did the test well; he has done a great job.": "audio/cau/a6f61635ce93b0e4.mp3", "Please sit down on the chair.": "audio/cau/08cb6a07df1ed303.mp3", "The cat jumps up and then comes down.": "audio/cau/009acd9ad7b1a705.mp3", "One drawback of city life is noise.": "audio/cau/10dccd039fb22db1.mp3", "City life has advantages, but pollution is a big drawback.": "audio/cau/e5786e9e2375675e.mp3", "Sorry, I couldn't get online earlier.": "audio/cau/8645d7f72d7fbd0a.mp3", "I get up early, but my mum gets up earlier.": "audio/cau/1bd88fc4d35df5af.mp3", "Steve Jobs' early life was not easy.": "audio/cau/870d0cf6ff3509a5.mp3", "Lan came early, but Nam came late.": "audio/cau/c338abccaad4e9f4.mp3", "Mi makes friends easily at school.": "audio/cau/eedb13c811943ed4.mp3", "The test was easy, so I finished it easily.": "audio/cau/7cb7e2c3342cf293.mp3", "This English exercise is very easy.": "audio/cau/708befc5d340e6e4.mp3", "This question is easy, but that one is difficult.": "audio/cau/6ec1dbc0277d41ef.mp3", "Parents encourage children to read books.": "audio/cau/e023715e37fdca1c.mp3", "My teacher's encouragement makes me want to try harder.": "audio/cau/0c43bb2e98cce98e.mp3", "At the end of the story, he became a hero.": "audio/cau/4cef74a2fd4fb11a.mp3", "We read to the end, and the ending was happy.": "audio/cau/fc827bfa0e26aa94.mp3", "I enjoy living in the city.": "audio/cau/1cc10e53aebeec12.mp3", "We enjoy the trip because it is very enjoyable.": "audio/cau/1a682a8a24ff63b3.mp3", "City life is exciting for teens.": "audio/cau/28945e456a70e4ca.mp3", "The trip was exciting, so we were very excited.": "audio/cau/53c60dbfd0e789cf.mp3", "Houses in the city are expensive.": "audio/cau/53d09ce3370d8fca.mp3", "This bag is expensive, but that one is cheap.": "audio/cau/d708d9a2b5676f1d.mp3", "Hoi An is famous for its lanterns.": "audio/cau/be0831db3c3bf621.mp3", "General Giap became famous, and his fame spread worldwide.": "audio/cau/4eabd5e77fd10a06.mp3", "My school is not far from my house.": "audio/cau/fa693a015c0f0c90.mp3", "Phong's house is farther from school than mine.": "audio/cau/a8e4b376469602b6.mp3", "The park is farther from my house than the school.": "audio/cau/57440ac0cbf1421c.mp3", "Hoa lives far from school, but Lan lives farther.": "audio/cau/1cfcda03be6a4095.mp3", "City life is fast and busy.": "audio/cau/19460b2172566c3b.mp3", "Minh runs fast, but Nam runs faster.": "audio/cau/5811391018cae65d.mp3", "My father is a doctor in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/ad3b88cec9d38c40.mp3", "Hoa's father and grandfather are both farmers.": "audio/cau/86e9c9df994f954c.mp3", "My favourite room is the kitchen.": "audio/cau/7fe9b9a43268f379.mp3", "Football is Nam's favourite sport.": "audio/cau/5418f30ef37044b0.mp3", "I'm fine, thanks. And you?": "audio/cau/4ae012a7118588c0.mp3", "The weather is fine today, so we feel well.": "audio/cau/751a59acef6b991a.mp3", "I finish my homework before dinner.": "audio/cau/4c12023029931700.mp3", "Hoa started the project in May and finished it in June.": "audio/cau/92423d5fe3d5c777.mp3", "Use the past simple for finished events.": "audio/cau/15e768d53722862d.mp3", "We finished our visual story yesterday.": "audio/cau/da44bbf9abdec66f.mp3", "Cycling keeps the body fit.": "audio/cau/afdb7ccf9257c0e5.mp3", "Hung plays badminton to keep fit.": "audio/cau/3fe2ba8717294893.mp3", "Focus on the main events in his life.": "audio/cau/568e05bcb3ccde4d.mp3", "It's noisy, so Mi can't concentrate or focus on homework.": "audio/cau/e984cbce9e79c312.mp3", "Follow the steps to make your poster.": "audio/cau/6579733e7f4abc4a.mp3", "Minh followed his teacher's advice and passed the exam.": "audio/cau/9fff6306c664e2d9.mp3", "Answer the following questions.": "audio/cau/7a648aa7c194b903.mp3", "We followed the plan the following day.": "audio/cau/f2e1b58551411942.mp3", "What do you do in your free time?": "audio/cau/561d82e572a21e67.mp3", "I am busy today, but I am free tomorrow.": "audio/cau/ed0144aa5c166e1b.mp3", "Lan is my good friend.": "audio/cau/dd872f787d0777d3.mp3", "My friend Minh is very friendly.": "audio/cau/4f7040d4f93a465f.mp3", "Our new teacher is very friendly.": "audio/cau/0062f01a22f8a341.mp3", "Nam is friendly and has many friends.": "audio/cau/1865a7313d83db0c.mp3", "Mi and Lan are good friends.": "audio/cau/4315a79df8d3aac1.mp3", "Nam is friendly, so he makes friends easily.": "audio/cau/50b0e863c6e406f4.mp3", "Our friendship is very important to me.": "audio/cau/01f0404c79a2081f.mp3", "Lan and Hoa are close friends; their friendship is strong.": "audio/cau/9389591d845cf52e.mp3", "After a good sleep, Lan is fully alert in class.": "audio/cau/e731cef6fdf5dd54.mp3", "Minh hasn't fully recovered from his cold.": "audio/cau/8cd54850c26f30ee.mp3", "My new school is further from home.": "audio/cau/75bf280216804478.mp3", "Hoa walks far, but Minh walks further.": "audio/cau/2debf8693d0b2c6c.mp3", "The word 'garden' starts with the letter G.": "audio/cau/855344adad6266b6.mp3", "Please write a capital G on the board.": "audio/cau/090b2d929a80461a.mp3", "My friend gave me a book for my birthday.": "audio/cau/301ff487a1615458.mp3", "Lan gives gifts to friends; last year she gave me a pen.": "audio/cau/759dbf022fa0c89a.mp3", "I get up at six o'clock every day.": "audio/cau/0449db3f3777d108.mp3", "Mi got a letter from her pen friend yesterday.": "audio/cau/84f62d6a67e5f9cb.mp3", "Please give me your notebook.": "audio/cau/63fd3e27b3248933.mp3", "Hoa gives her mum flowers; yesterday she gave her a card.": "audio/cau/8a999a2635280ba0.mp3", "Lan finishes her project within the given time.": "audio/cau/e0a4a7e575000b77.mp3", "Our teacher has given us three tasks this week.": "audio/cau/cd0bbafcb1fa540b.mp3", "My teacher gives us a lot of homework.": "audio/cau/9e792e0228b9fc48.mp3", "Mi always gives good advice, and she gave me some today.": "audio/cau/9d8952d03493a72d.mp3", "Thank you for giving me this present.": "audio/cau/f8cd8738e3f78cef.mp3", "Nam is giving out the books that the teacher gave him.": "audio/cau/7b770ff6437f99d6.mp3", "I go to school by bike.": "audio/cau/df5dcef1ab40916f.mp3", "We often go to the beach; last summer we went to Nha Trang.": "audio/cau/9dac5f396b6a209e.mp3", "Mi goes to school by bike.": "audio/cau/c289e58e0081ccad.mp3", "Nam usually goes swimming, but yesterday he went to the park.": "audio/cau/913dc197023c0f8a.mp3", "We are going to visit Hoi An.": "audio/cau/caf0fb980152def1.mp3", "Lan is going to school now; she goes by bus.": "audio/cau/c4af9d8c2b576c6c.mp3", "Nam is good at maths.": "audio/cau/4fd3587c745c05a2.mp3", "Lan's English is good, but Mi's is better.": "audio/cau/d371c25a8502dc92.mp3", "I got stuck in a traffic jam and came home late.": "audio/cau/fffb27ec64b971e2.mp3", "Mi usually gets up at six, but today she got up at seven.": "audio/cau/787111ee3d018017.mp3", "My grandfather is 75 years old.": "audio/cau/aaac8af2aea80407.mp3", "My grandfather and grandmother live in Hue.": "audio/cau/a198eed6e615b9c6.mp3", "That's a great idea for our project!": "audio/cau/a54aafc7aa505f92.mp3", "We had a great time; the trip was wonderful.": "audio/cau/3dc3e9c44a5960ce.mp3", "Each group has four members.": "audio/cau/6db9bb96270db26c.mp3", "Work in groups and report your group's findings.": "audio/cau/dd390edb36c261a2.mp3", "The teacher puts us into groups of five.": "audio/cau/ec8808da410c34e5.mp3", "Our class has six groups, and each group has six students.": "audio/cau/0f693c5a4478ab4f.mp3", "I am happy to see my friends again.": "audio/cau/29fdd3b9f6ed1e66.mp3", "Mi smiles happily because she is happy.": "audio/cau/feee63efb252ba2b.mp3", "The maths test was very hard.": "audio/cau/0fd61471858155e3.mp3", "Minh works hard; he is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/32c549e4a9f6fc13.mp3", "Lan is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/5b3ff11d5293f4e5.mp3", "Nam is hardworking, and he never gets lazy.": "audio/cau/06cd2484f9437f49.mp3", "I hate waiting for the bus in the rain.": "audio/cau/3f99a8ce5b4ab56c.mp3", "Nam likes city life, but he hates traffic jams.": "audio/cau/6300158d6a0d3117.mp3", "Fresh air is good for your health.": "audio/cau/4e56d220f37f4d46.mp3", "Eat healthy food to keep good health.": "audio/cau/229acac5b67f1724.mp3", "Life in the countryside is healthier.": "audio/cau/75e5ce0c7e5245b8.mp3", "Fruit is healthy, and it is healthier than sweets.": "audio/cau/07d932ed0f8d8e57.mp3", "Minh eats healthily and goes to bed early.": "audio/cau/767c8f27243696ad.mp3", "To live healthily, Lan does exercise every morning.": "audio/cau/c444def93ae1a281.mp3", "Eating vegetables helps you stay healthy.": "audio/cau/db56d82300b94fea.mp3", "Good health is important, so eat healthy food.": "audio/cau/e0e29e3d98c8d03d.mp3", "Can you help me with my homework?": "audio/cau/59064ec1f34486d3.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she always helps her mum cook.": "audio/cau/82b6e08d58022ab1.mp3", "A street cleaner is a community helper.": "audio/cau/4e5627311f32688c.mp3", "The helper always helps old people cross the road.": "audio/cau/5d453af4870fad09.mp3", "The map is very helpful for tourists.": "audio/cau/01dfa6b6d0d2dc96.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she often helps her neighbours.": "audio/cau/28366edc55c3b71c.mp3", "My bedroom is here, next to the kitchen.": "audio/cau/38f5476965ee13ae.mp3", "Come here, Nam! Your bag is over there.": "audio/cau/1518838d605d3769.mp3", "Match each highlighted word with its definition.": "audio/cau/2054b6647f7ccadc.mp3", "Lan highlighted the new words with a yellow highlighter.": "audio/cau/ecd4a9023406bc13.mp3", "I go home at five o'clock.": "audio/cau/a74ab800c921a80b.mp3", "After school, Mi does her homework at home.": "audio/cau/ecaf6456acc0b85d.mp3", "Nam does his homework at home every evening.": "audio/cau/0c529025b7e7c4aa.mp3", "In the hot sun, he is always at the school gate.": "audio/cau/d94f7911dc61672f.mp3", "The heat is terrible today; it's so hot!": "audio/cau/15a129bda3aabffd.mp3", "I do my homework for an hour every evening.": "audio/cau/ada27edeb21f8fa6.mp3", "The bus comes hourly, so we wait an hour.": "audio/cau/3f37385bc8e75b24.mp3", "Our house is near the river.": "audio/cau/462620c6e9d42610.mp3", "Lan's house is big, so the housework takes a long time.": "audio/cau/ffae3b516fc16794.mp3", "Lan helps her mother with the housework.": "audio/cau/603758dd29202743.mp3", "I do housework at weekends, like cleaning the house.": "audio/cau/603861c40de6e77e.mp3", "How did he become a famous doctor?": "audio/cau/0acfb865542d1705.mp3", "How old is Minh, and how does he go to school?": "audio/cau/0d6be1faa0d18a2b.mp3", "He was poor. However, he never gave up.": "audio/cau/893555bad2aff789.mp3", "It rained. However, Nam still went to school, but late.": "audio/cau/97115d20f691f7e4.mp3", "My school is big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/d5765e25cafa0eea.mp3", "Today it is sunny, but yesterday it was rainy.": "audio/cau/ed1bcaf6501bfd0c.mp3", "Nam isn't at home now.": "audio/cau/064ea182a69f9ba0.mp3", "This is my bag, but that one isn't.": "audio/cau/93f1c4d3918a4422.mp3", "We were late because of a traffic jam.": "audio/cau/e56d04589badd4a4.mp3", "There is a jam on Le Loi Street, so the roads are jammed.": "audio/cau/927ab8d456162167.mp3", "Traffic jams happen every day in big cities.": "audio/cau/9fe4d41002977588.mp3", "There is a jam near my school, and it makes us late.": "audio/cau/ee60f52e294f4e40.mp3", "My teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/a4408f8940b23d7a.mp3", "Hoa is kind to everyone, but her brother is sometimes unkind.": "audio/cau/92eef49a76085d2d.mp3", "Do you know his life story?": "audio/cau/db0ea43493818ad0.mp3", "I know her well; I knew her at primary school.": "audio/cau/26baffaf9e8a0ddb.mp3", "Uncle Ho is known and loved by all Vietnamese people.": "audio/cau/e714527fbec233eb.mp3", "Many people know him; he is well known in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/ea446edd847c7b43.mp3", "The word 'lamp' starts with the letter l.": "audio/cau/c5e08a5413a4f66b.mp3", "Please write a capital L on the board.": "audio/cau/63173cda63a08912.mp3", "My house has a large garden.": "audio/cau/aca5eaaef305eea5.mp3", "Their house is large, and their garden is very big.": "audio/cau/58f11bb60767bcfb.mp3", "I visited my grandparents last weekend.": "audio/cau/553e8bea75bbdbbd.mp3", "Last Sunday was fun, and next Sunday will be fun too.": "audio/cau/17be93822cc3c397.mp3", "Don't be late for school!": "audio/cau/2de1bb7c8bcc4ad3.mp3", "Mi was late, but Nam came early.": "audio/cau/1f3ff224e4611670.mp3", "Later, he became a famous doctor.": "audio/cau/07a3d83c155c22a7.mp3", "I was late; I'll call you later.": "audio/cau/48c24516af887381.mp3", "We learn English at school.": "audio/cau/9bc26f3d76057248.mp3", "Nam wants to learn to swim, and his sister learnt last year.": "audio/cau/5a7392296080d626.mp3", "Students need to sleep at least eight hours a day.": "audio/cau/06d7a5fd2aadd1a8.mp3", "Nam has less homework than Mi, and Lan has the least.": "audio/cau/144df5d8b5b5a253.mp3", "He had to leave school at the age of fifteen.": "audio/cau/0036ab8cf9a331c5.mp3", "We leave home at six; yesterday we left at seven.": "audio/cau/d3d9e5743a9b9bd0.mp3", "Village life is less noisy than city life.": "audio/cau/00a225b39b028bcc.mp3", "I have little time, less than Mi; Nam has the least.": "audio/cau/310826397361a2bd.mp3", "Let me help you with your bags.": "audio/cau/41dd52ad0f012862.mp3", "Mum let me go out yesterday; she lets me go on Sundays.": "audio/cau/46fc2d4c33221e5d.mp3", "Students read books in the school library.": "audio/cau/652b3f1867b52ca4.mp3", "The librarian helps us find books in the library.": "audio/cau/75a040e0524410b2.mp3", "He had a difficult life when he was young.": "audio/cau/0e2c7b87c896e8b7.mp3", "City life is busy, and people live very fast.": "audio/cau/c7a56b97906b19d2.mp3", "I like noodles very much.": "audio/cau/7557928354c11c4a.mp3", "I like cats, but I dislike spiders.": "audio/cau/bdd9c25c87fbc823.mp3", "Minh likes playing football.": "audio/cau/8b21f729dbeb8632.mp3", "Hoa likes music, but I like art.": "audio/cau/e9144dc6f8053afb.mp3", "Which line comes after 'We're playing together'?": "audio/cau/ad977311b8dcbfd2.mp3", "Read the first line of the chant aloud.": "audio/cau/36ef301fe6cfba19.mp3", "Please listen to Lan's life story carefully.": "audio/cau/5e66ffcca03d62ba.mp3", "Minh is a good listener; he always listens to his friends.": "audio/cau/2a4b1d64993cd32a.mp3", "Thank you for listening.": "audio/cau/ee26d140bc752b99.mp3", "Nam is listening to music; he loves to listen to pop songs.": "audio/cau/8451afe66a0bd788.mp3", "My little brother is five years old.": "audio/cau/e22af4e6bb3d77f0.mp3", "I have a little money, but my sister has less.": "audio/cau/520fdc680c743ed9.mp3", "We live in a small village.": "audio/cau/8438d091662da029.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside and have a happy life.": "audio/cau/a21ec63c6b42bc8d.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is very lively at night.": "audio/cau/f7f9de50246fc30a.mp3", "The market is lively and busy in the morning.": "audio/cau/be87297ba2d5a7fc.mp3", "There is a big sofa in the living room.": "audio/cau/85ee341c5ccef3a3.mp3", "We live in a small house with a nice living room.": "audio/cau/a4537e161135cc8a.mp3", "I love my family.": "audio/cau/02c5061798cc56cc.mp3", "My grandma is loving, and I love her a lot.": "audio/cau/588e4f5967e2076b.mp3", "My mother is a loving person.": "audio/cau/5a0aadfbccb5dec1.mp3", "Hoa has a loving family, and she loves them a lot.": "audio/cau/dbfb0082905aad2d.mp3", "I'm a student at Nguyen Du High School.": "audio/cau/fc4e40becc452649.mp3", "I'm happy because I am with my best friends.": "audio/cau/70dc61c954d001ef.mp3", "He made his first computer in a small garage.": "audio/cau/ab57132318aeca10.mp3", "This vase is made of clay; people make it in Bat Trang.": "audio/cau/e23523961a9ed154.mp3", "Hard work can make your dreams come true.": "audio/cau/b31d6220b696ab85.mp3", "He made many mistakes, but he learnt to make good choices.": "audio/cau/f95abe45aba09ae8.mp3", "How do you manage to get to school in heavy traffic?": "audio/cau/8761ae4a73d3c515.mp3", "My uncle is a manager; he manages a small hotel.": "audio/cau/4c7dad12218fd85f.mp3", "Good time management helps Mai do well at school.": "audio/cau/67b1d65ea2788b16.mp3", "Minh reads tips on time management.": "audio/cau/160ad9528e8ef2b9.mp3", "Hoa uses red to mark exam days on her calendar.": "audio/cau/78135abe90fe0ad6.mp3", "Nam marks his due dates with a yellow pen.": "audio/cau/9321f43accfdd88b.mp3", "We have our exams in May.": "audio/cau/596706c87a49f74e.mp3", "May is a hot month in the south.": "audio/cau/a0fc44757a99e818.mp3", "What does 'craft village' mean?": "audio/cau/4c5a16ea9baf9474.mp3", "What do these words mean? Let's check their meaning.": "audio/cau/2a235e867bbba30d.mp3", "Look up the meaning of new words in a dictionary.": "audio/cau/d2030b4713d39b26.mp3", "This gift has a special meaning, so it is meaningful to me.": "audio/cau/d0dcab7ed3224224.mp3", "Success means hard work and patience.": "audio/cau/72e93e8785cd9669.mp3", "This word means 'kind'; I learnt what it meant yesterday.": "audio/cau/38e48e5adf61e68d.mp3", "Ha Noi now has a metro line.": "audio/cau/bd92620d3c8a1fd7.mp3", "The metro is fast, so many people take the metro to work.": "audio/cau/c3507817098f96ed.mp3", "It might rain this afternoon.": "audio/cau/589baf8012a56c85.mp3", "We might go to the cinema, or we may stay at home.": "audio/cau/fc671e1a8724cc7e.mp3", "My mother is a nurse.": "audio/cau/7504a7ce3f463355.mp3", "Mi's mother, her mum, cooks very well.": "audio/cau/4860342249a4a0b1.mp3", "Mr Nam is our English teacher.": "audio/cau/38bbba50eac133a3.mp3", "Mr Minh and Ms Lan work at my school.": "audio/cau/22a842da4f6100e9.mp3", "Ms Hoa teaches us maths.": "audio/cau/f0b35b8376d075b8.mp3", "Ms Lan and Mr Phong are our class teachers.": "audio/cau/6709f6324593fcc8.mp3", "My mum works in a hospital.": "audio/cau/6797efc1f7e404e7.mp3", "I love my mum; she is a kind mother.": "audio/cau/9c8b3cd7b9c8ebfc.mp3", "You must wear a uniform at school.": "audio/cau/46580b2b85391334.mp3", "We must be quiet, and we mustn't run in the classroom.": "audio/cau/c40bacc8d34e5f31.mp3", "In 'running', we double the letter n.": "audio/cau/f2d3227ba2e63feb.mp3", "Run ends in n, so we write running with two n's.": "audio/cau/840a0ecac7ac2b05.mp3", "What is your full name?": "audio/cau/3560e14e0864aa5c.mp3", "Name two products Jobs introduced after 1997.": "audio/cau/2fa79a695478cb53.mp3", "There is a big park nearby.": "audio/cau/0bbea8d853e59092.mp3", "My school is near my house, and a market is nearby too.": "audio/cau/b046b21263949e43.mp3", "The school is nearer to my house than the market.": "audio/cau/5ab3eb0827d8a997.mp3", "The park is near, the bus stop is nearer, the shop is nearest.": "audio/cau/7a383b34e10fdcad.mp3", "It's nearly six o'clock, so let's go home.": "audio/cau/245ae82d42650c9f.mp3", "Nam nearly missed the bus; he was almost late.": "audio/cau/b606a8d1edcf35c6.mp3", "She never gave up her dream.": "audio/cau/b95a5dea82e7f24d.mp3", "Never give up; always try your best.": "audio/cau/45044467beb1d1bf.mp3", "He started a new life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c5e37434302d9841.mp3", "This bike is new, but that one is old.": "audio/cau/dae26bf3d19dc70a.mp3", "I watch the news on TV every evening.": "audio/cau/4eec6079f4f4c6a3.mp3", "The news is good: a new park is open.": "audio/cau/c4024e28c9bf5003.mp3", "See you next week!": "audio/cau/e955abbc627cb84b.mp3", "Last week we had a test, and next week we have a trip.": "audio/cau/e51bba1694cc9fe2.mp3", "Nice to meet you, Mai.": "audio/cau/7c4c4da145e9a59d.mp3", "Lan is nice, and she always speaks nicely.": "audio/cau/b93deacf2eeac62d.mp3", "She did not give up her dream.": "audio/cau/b5d39e3052bc5fbb.mp3", "I am not tired, and I'm not hungry.": "audio/cau/9485504d93b05a38.mp3", "Make a note of the new words.": "audio/cau/8bdaf02876855cac.mp3", "I write a short note in my notebook.": "audio/cau/3b565057bfcdee58.mp3", "I write new words in my notebook.": "audio/cau/54f4386b8856f178.mp3", "Mi's notebook is full of short notes.": "audio/cau/684bf34705fb9a6b.mp3", "Take notes while you listen.": "audio/cau/a76ebe77aa288aab.mp3", "I write a short note and keep all my notes in a notebook.": "audio/cau/26f4f6be6ec1126c.mp3", "Turn off the lights when you leave.": "audio/cau/3a68f3ab6e248006.mp3", "Turn on the fan, but turn off the TV.": "audio/cau/bdd957c99adde5f0.mp3", "Offer help to people who need it.": "audio/cau/f02476a54a1325af.mp3", "Big cities offer many jobs.": "audio/cau/18f026c4fe912248.mp3", "Offering help to others is kind.": "audio/cau/353eef20358dfeb2.mp3", "The new mall is offering big discounts.": "audio/cau/91c4cc3b973b2835.mp3", "Da Nang offers beautiful beaches.": "audio/cau/843fcc6cba9d8daa.mp3", "This city offers many jobs, and it provides good schools.": "audio/cau/c6a3846d3523a8b6.mp3", "I often get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/08008a46175a2d25.mp3", "Minh often reads books, but he never plays games.": "audio/cau/a29cadde346ad9ba.mp3", "Please open your books to page twenty.": "audio/cau/53593951c79684b4.mp3", "Open the window, but close the door.": "audio/cau/7aa87d369a509fca.mp3", "Our school will organise a book fair.": "audio/cau/b60074767f2a5421.mp3", "Mi is the organiser; she will organise the party.": "audio/cau/8bfcae283bbdf81d.mp3", "Mi went out with her friends last night.": "audio/cau/6662db3eac9ce4e0.mp3", "Nam wants to find out more about his grandfather's life.": "audio/cau/c2c4b3120ecb6468.mp3", "The city has many outdoor markets.": "audio/cau/70f031e665dcb6a3.mp3", "Phong likes outdoor sports, so he often plays outdoors.": "audio/cau/62d7cb3e1f835b37.mp3", "The film starts at 8 p.m.": "audio/cau/5b3d11f7cb5bec98.mp3", "School finishes at 4.30 p.m., and I have dinner at 7 p.m.": "audio/cau/6193e0ae396e4d78.mp3", "The workers pack the silk scarves into boxes.": "audio/cau/fb20eff00e9edb32.mp3", "Mi packs her bag, and her mum unpacks it after the trip.": "audio/cau/328c5412cf5f0d19.mp3", "The bus was packed with students this morning.": "audio/cau/61e071dde6dcfc00.mp3", "The market is packed at the weekend but empty at night.": "audio/cau/19507b738fe0d95c.mp3", "I need a new pair of shoes for school.": "audio/cau/250c1c4ccfb0d448.mp3", "Find a partner and work in pairs.": "audio/cau/9f9cc8d6f86e7886.mp3", "Work in pairs and ask each other questions.": "audio/cau/2bae203d74ef1339.mp3", "There are ten pairs, so each pair gets one card.": "audio/cau/6a0e4948c63a816b.mp3", "This part of the lesson is about friends.": "audio/cau/fe137d473624dc0c.mp3", "We take part in the game, and it is partly about music.": "audio/cau/f86fd833e90206a2.mp3", "Ask your partner about his favourite food.": "audio/cau/422fdd4d69934397.mp3", "Minh is my partner, and we work in pairs.": "audio/cau/c79cf650c67747ae.mp3", "The lesson has three parts.": "audio/cau/1b1d9c097e2f0ab4.mp3", "Name the parts of the face: eyes, nose and mouth.": "audio/cau/1959d4fcb37c5b1b.mp3", "How much do you pay for a bowl of pho?": "audio/cau/e807ddb92a3f24db.mp3", "Mum paid for the books yesterday.": "audio/cau/15922b0414be0bc7.mp3", "I use my phone to call my grandparents.": "audio/cau/8e9996c8fa495f09.mp3", "Lan phoned me last night on her new phone.": "audio/cau/8ac9d116e44bf63f.mp3", "She phoned her mother every evening.": "audio/cau/349bb738f214ff06.mp3", "Nam phoned Minh, and Minh called him back.": "audio/cau/23c05f3d2997559f.mp3", "My uncle picked us up at the bus station.": "audio/cau/b0c8e2d47baf7115.mp3", "Lan picked some flowers in the garden.": "audio/cau/ce45c98795b6b9e7.mp3", "This is a nice place to live.": "audio/cau/160e9180eaed0aee.mp3", "Let's meet at the usual place after school.": "audio/cau/f760c0b8e65d51b8.mp3", "There are many interesting places in my town.": "audio/cau/22530fda716b27a9.mp3", "The market is my favourite place in town.": "audio/cau/6904ef4273568097.mp3", "We need a plan for our project.": "audio/cau/e33a8fe9fb341903.mp3", "Nam planned his trip carefully with his family.": "audio/cau/f61c169a10484b3b.mp3", "Good planning helps you study better.": "audio/cau/3e380d555c079d24.mp3", "Make a plan for your week and use a planner.": "audio/cau/c7d1745603e5bd75.mp3", "We had a pleasant day at the craft village.": "audio/cau/e1f0b1cdb0d3b469.mp3", "The weather is pleasant today, not unpleasant like yesterday.": "audio/cau/d39fb3e0aac88724.mp3", "I'm pleased to meet you.": "audio/cau/f7277017f0c93fd1.mp3", "The teacher is pleased with our work.": "audio/cau/ef3a88639bfe5e25.mp3", "It's a pleasure to talk to you.": "audio/cau/eff2f68747b92dda.mp3", "Reading gives my grandmother a lot of pleasure.": "audio/cau/09e7f994211010c0.mp3", "Football practice is on Saturday morning.": "audio/cau/6494d311fac68397.mp3", "We practise English every day because practice makes perfect.": "audio/cau/41b3647f667733f3.mp3", "Each group will present their project to the class.": "audio/cau/6116c3864aebd817.mp3", "Hoa presented her project about her grandfather.": "audio/cau/199806383df2605a.mp3", "Our group gave a presentation about a famous person.": "audio/cau/19eabc250c35918d.mp3", "Minh presents the first part of the presentation.": "audio/cau/97ffec456b1ba8a6.mp3", "Let's have a quick look at the poster.": "audio/cau/74f69b26a440762a.mp3", "Nam is a quick learner, so he learns quickly.": "audio/cau/5e11bac22bdaf305.mp3", "She quickly became famous.": "audio/cau/69d2407f5c23a407.mp3", "Minh walks quickly, but his brother walks slowly.": "audio/cau/df1476232b08c52c.mp3", "The library is a quiet place.": "audio/cau/cf5d391e8e881e58.mp3", "My village is quieter and more peaceful than the city.": "audio/cau/fe9afae0f73f7b97.mp3", "I rarely go to the cinema.": "audio/cau/665f28d3968d7eec.mp3", "Snow is rare in Ha Noi, so we rarely see it.": "audio/cau/651a9aa109c5d5ab.mp3", "We're playing in the park now.": "audio/cau/ce568c1634d30075.mp3", "They're my friends, and they are very kind.": "audio/cau/aea78a52a03a937e.mp3", "We can reach the city centre by bus.": "audio/cau/04ff8a28c2c1ea1e.mp3", "The bus line doesn't reach my village yet.": "audio/cau/7e34175d758a85c7.mp3", "I read a book before bed every night.": "audio/cau/52f4120305948c56.mp3", "Yesterday Mi read a story, because reading is her hobby.": "audio/cau/a206c7fecbd29a47.mp3", "My sister is a fast reader.": "audio/cau/c997b3414e90f2e3.mp3", "Lan is a good reader because she reads every day.": "audio/cau/804882ef0e352a60.mp3", "Reading helps us learn new words.": "audio/cau/a36b0142402545f6.mp3", "I read a story last night, and it was great.": "audio/cau/67941e0da7d7be3c.mp3", "I ride my bike to school every day.": "audio/cau/740570dda66f2738.mp3", "Nam rode his bike to the park yesterday.": "audio/cau/1bec2f7f84326c5b.mp3", "Mi is riding her bike in the park.": "audio/cau/148c59e681cad362.mp3", "Phong likes riding; he rode for an hour today.": "audio/cau/c9e27d7938167490.mp3", "This road is busy in the morning.": "audio/cau/84aea104087d60d6.mp3", "The roads in the city are often crowded.": "audio/cau/f4720f3bd15cb73a.mp3", "This road is wide, but other roads are narrow.": "audio/cau/6df87d5b47381d5e.mp3", "Please put your rubbish in the bin.": "audio/cau/3797d15061da27bc.mp3", "Nam picks up litter and other rubbish in the park.": "audio/cau/2004fa74d47adf15.mp3", "I run in the park every morning.": "audio/cau/3fed1cc1643c52ce.mp3", "Mi ran very fast; she is a good runner.": "audio/cau/48f4e8245e306883.mp3", "The children are running in the schoolyard.": "audio/cau/cd547a363770b5c2.mp3", "Nam loves running, and he ran five kilometres today.": "audio/cau/f921a02636522e0b.mp3", "The roads are very busy at rush hour.": "audio/cau/39bdc0de029bc4b8.mp3", "Nam rushed to school because he was late.": "audio/cau/957954b5e102b4d6.mp3", "She's my best friend in class 6A.": "audio/cau/810592fcf73e04e7.mp3", "This is Vinh's bike, and he's in my class.": "audio/cau/6a8b8131a5222edf.mp3", "Mi and I are in the same class.": "audio/cau/bc1a18955ee28275.mp3", "My bag is the same as yours, not different.": "audio/cau/b8e990694854227f.mp3", "Firefighters save people from burning buildings.": "audio/cau/455006b1a6cd17b8.mp3", "Lan saves money and keeps her savings in a box.": "audio/cau/cd1cde14a55133aa.mp3", "I put my books in my schoolbag before school.": "audio/cau/c492164eb59da7f4.mp3", "Jobs and Wozniak set up Apple in 1976.": "audio/cau/48673803c7bf8992.mp3", "Mi set her alarm for six o'clock yesterday.": "audio/cau/92e32160df23e27c.mp3", "Show your photos to the class.": "audio/cau/2238dc578e393ea6.mp3", "Nam showed us photos of his village.": "audio/cau/212c93e8427b7095.mp3", "The artisan showed us how to make lanterns.": "audio/cau/897188b380de15ca.mp3", "Please show me too; you showed Mi yesterday.": "audio/cau/f493ef15d21acfbb.mp3", "Life in my city is similar to life in yours.": "audio/cau/b89b4fb5bd2e62ee.mp3", "Hoa and Lan look similar, but their hobbies are different.": "audio/cau/612906abb392c0a7.mp3", "Use simple words in your presentation.": "audio/cau/685b89e962568275.mp3", "The task is simple; simply read and answer.": "audio/cau/f9dad5cdcce61ac9.mp3", "What would you do in this situation?": "audio/cau/03c3e0ab3b25e897.mp3", "Read each situation and give your partner advice.": "audio/cau/ed2f814bde2d2deb.mp3", "Role-play the situations in pairs.": "audio/cau/4ac681841b8c9a30.mp3", "Hoa knows what to do in difficult situations.": "audio/cau/216f1f6ab8c96a8a.mp3", "The sky in the city is often grey.": "audio/cau/bba5ce7e2093219f.mp3", "Tall skyscrapers seem to touch the sky.": "audio/cau/26554b746909ff55.mp3", "The skytrain is fast and convenient.": "audio/cau/c65707dd3a8d78e8.mp3", "Mi takes the skytrain across the city every day.": "audio/cau/7b869837d908f0be.mp3", "The bus is slow at rush hour.": "audio/cau/732f025c97062de8.mp3", "Drivers should slow down near the school gate.": "audio/cau/80ba3032c253c920.mp3", "My house is small but cosy.": "audio/cau/361843b6d8177bed.mp3", "I live in a small flat, not a big house.": "audio/cau/e341afdae498f225.mp3", "Ha Noi is planning to become a smart city.": "audio/cau/534a2d2742fd455c.mp3", "My smart cousin made an app for smartphones.": "audio/cau/a451335c10c8aa7f.mp3", "Many teenagers use a smartphone every day.": "audio/cau/5ebfc7f85b461743.mp3", "Nam's smartphone is smart: it can translate English.": "audio/cau/023fcc72924c361c.mp3", "I'm so pleased you won the prize!": "audio/cau/345d567c5208a7af.mp3", "It was raining, so we stayed at home.": "audio/cau/d3e8c1c4c40bf63a.mp3", "I sometimes walk to school with Nam.": "audio/cau/58614921c43016ec.mp3", "Mi sometimes cooks dinner with her mum.": "audio/cau/cc769dc4c6e5b938.mp3", "Can you speak English well?": "audio/cau/7e70c8ed41dd5f73.mp3", "Mi spoke to her teacher after class.": "audio/cau/9631c4f9d08103cf.mp3", "Our head teacher gave a short speech today.": "audio/cau/d7f9999a0661fac2.mp3", "Mi will speak first, then Nam will give his speech.": "audio/cau/e7405c38166acf2a.mp3", "I spend two hours a day on homework.": "audio/cau/ae8ce0fa171861ef.mp3", "Nam spent all his money, but Hoa saved hers.": "audio/cau/cde2e5b991e7d5b7.mp3", "Mi is spending the weekend with her grandparents.": "audio/cau/7f4ff17f55fa56f3.mp3", "Last summer, Nam spent a month in Da Lat.": "audio/cau/f5a09b7bd4a21d52.mp3", "Our English lesson will start at eight.": "audio/cau/920ac7d03b952080.mp3", "We start at seven and finish at eleven.": "audio/cau/f8b0988a876acebc.mp3", "Stick your photo on the poster.": "audio/cau/779d195adf710a93.mp3", "Hoa stuck a sticker on her notebook.": "audio/cau/56b2d23c9b0c6935.mp3", "We eat sticky rice for breakfast.": "audio/cau/91c2a380db2c2366.mp3", "The rice is sticky, so it sticks to my fingers.": "audio/cau/3e09038e8ef4cf37.mp3", "Please stop talking and listen to me.": "audio/cau/14d99e9f18d5a441.mp3", "The bus will stop here and then start again.": "audio/cau/2af4e67bdadcfda0.mp3", "There are many shops on this street.": "audio/cau/3f780db4db7c5418.mp3", "Lan loves street food in the Old Quarter.": "audio/cau/88f07584eb11353e.mp3", "The streets in Ha Noi are busy at rush hour.": "audio/cau/9d135f4e1e753d49.mp3", "This street is quiet, but the other streets are noisy.": "audio/cau/ef9a487276d660b4.mp3", "We were stuck in a traffic jam for an hour.": "audio/cau/8f8163c7cc36a889.mp3", "Nam got stuck in traffic, so he was late for school.": "audio/cau/660347e7d7131514.mp3", "Mi is a student at Ba Dinh Secondary School.": "audio/cau/569937b828afcac4.mp3", "Every student must study hard for the test.": "audio/cau/88443b78f0da0120.mp3", "There are forty students in my class.": "audio/cau/69f347ac209b4fc2.mp3", "Each student has a book, and all the students love our teacher.": "audio/cau/04de8679f0e55800.mp3", "Mi studies English every evening.": "audio/cau/b1218f9b9530760b.mp3", "Nam studied hard last year, and now he studies even harder.": "audio/cau/9817881934cebf3a.mp3", "I study English every evening.": "audio/cau/2a98035816ae0fe1.mp3", "Hoa is a studious student; she likes to study maths.": "audio/cau/81fcae64bc4c3e71.mp3", "My uncle lives in a quiet suburb of Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/de77851cc3a0a335.mp3", "Life in the suburb is quieter than in the city centre.": "audio/cau/e45ac8f499147469.mp3", "Many families move to the suburbs for more space.": "audio/cau/d55d207df96c9b07.mp3", "My school is in the city centre, but I live in the suburbs.": "audio/cau/a6150b961a8dbd3b.mp3", "Friends support each other in hard times.": "audio/cau/c25544ac51cf812c.mp3", "My parents are supportive; they always support me.": "audio/cau/bc09957a4f6cc0ae.mp3", "In \"don't\", the letter t comes from not.": "audio/cau/549e7bc5a2456c75.mp3", "I didn't go out because I was tired.": "audio/cau/5cc7479c1b749e64.mp3", "Put your books on the table, please.": "audio/cau/467dab8d487aa55a.mp3", "Our timetable is a table of all our lessons.": "audio/cau/995dc4d40f2b5ff8.mp3", "Don't forget to take your umbrella.": "audio/cau/d1c93b06561e343d.mp3", "I take the bus to school; yesterday I took a taxi.": "audio/cau/6de67298648ceb25.mp3", "I often talk to my grandma on the phone.": "audio/cau/30262ea1745db608.mp3", "Lan is talkative; she loves to talk and chat with friends.": "audio/cau/ef14453a567466fc.mp3", "My mother will teach me how to cook.": "audio/cau/a219134d114e3ba6.mp3", "Mr Minh taught me English, and he is a great teacher.": "audio/cau/f4262b30c0d7e28d.mp3", "Our English teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/4869000a32bce322.mp3", "Ms Hoa taught us maths last year; she is a great teacher.": "audio/cau/01cfa396481f53ff.mp3", "We are thankful to our teachers.": "audio/cau/7371a36dadb99e53.mp3", "Our teachers help us every day.": "audio/cau/7e121ff7d4ccdde3.mp3", "Ms Lan is teaching Class 6A now.": "audio/cau/acf50be4cb481bbc.mp3", "My aunt is a teacher; she loves teaching.": "audio/cau/8c228681a916a270.mp3", "My brother is a teen, so he wants his own room.": "audio/cau/c8eb1ac059c2bb4a.mp3", "A teenager is a teen between thirteen and nineteen.": "audio/cau/d1532a0567e7f8bc.mp3", "This camp is for teenagers aged 13 to 15.": "audio/cau/5cfe984ac3769531.mp3", "Many teenagers use phones, but adults use them too.": "audio/cau/21d9a5c45f2e6b47.mp3", "Many teens in the city feel stressed.": "audio/cau/369d9e6780081751.mp3", "Teens and teenagers mean the same thing.": "audio/cau/38da3d71f50d4767.mp3", "The traffic in the city is terrible today.": "audio/cau/01ea841928344884.mp3", "The food was terrible, but the view was wonderful.": "audio/cau/93b659e2b5f66a2e.mp3", "Thank you for your help.": "audio/cau/f1b6ff2034f49180.mp3", "I want to thank my teacher; I am thankful to her.": "audio/cau/e425280c59f568bd.mp3", "We are thankful to the people in our community.": "audio/cau/223a6b926026e8db.mp3", "I am thankful for your help, so I thank you a lot.": "audio/cau/6f44905722dacb4f.mp3", "I had breakfast, and then I went to school.": "audio/cau/e707895b95dcb0e6.mp3", "First, wash the rice. Next, cook it. Then, eat it.": "audio/cau/2bb6330c0be506ed.mp3", "There is a big garden in my house.": "audio/cau/94db3c106fafa1ac.mp3", "Your bag is here, and my bag is over there.": "audio/cau/37204e4c7e951d02.mp3", "What time is it now, Mum?": "audio/cau/1cbca6b4e0afa66c.mp3", "Look at the timetable; it is time for maths.": "audio/cau/9b6fb48058293171.mp3", "I'm optimistic about the exam I took last week.": "audio/cau/98111979a0b1df4c.mp3", "Minh took the bus to school.": "audio/cau/d8fe913a07c52d8e.mp3", "I totally agree with you.": "audio/cau/2ed025b410dc2507.mp3", "The town is totally different now; it changed completely.": "audio/cau/7c44b917714a1ef2.mp3", "I live in a small town near the sea.": "audio/cau/d1834f8b57570cad.mp3", "My town is bigger than my grandparents' village.": "audio/cau/5dce2eb178b20c1e.mp3", "The traffic is heavy at rush hour.": "audio/cau/42b9fe91ec37a1dd.mp3", "We went to Hue by train.": "audio/cau/0131cf3fca359ac1.mp3", "The train leaves the station at six.": "audio/cau/f47b7035aa339397.mp3", "Mai takes a training course on time management at school.": "audio/cau/a7ab4a64de2ddf3c.mp3", "Nam has football training every Saturday.": "audio/cau/594873cbffeb57ec.mp3", "Ha Noi had a tram system many years ago.": "audio/cau/cb2b8657dc2af2ba.mp3", "We can travel around the city by tram.": "audio/cau/c7ab364dc26a3fc9.mp3", "Public transport in our city is cheap.": "audio/cau/f6abaacdd3073e92.mp3", "Buses transport many people every day.": "audio/cau/8405fd1f5a5fd2da.mp3", "Good transportation helps the city grow.": "audio/cau/de9050e487e4e972.mp3", "Transportation in big cities is busy, so many people use public transport.": "audio/cau/38bbd8c9ae266c8b.mp3", "I want to travel around Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/0750a29d21b5efe2.mp3", "He travelled a lot; he was a real traveller.": "audio/cau/4dcdae3874eeaed4.mp3", "My grandfather travelled to many countries.": "audio/cau/107d8288b9a40c84.mp3", "She loves to travel and travelled to Sa Pa last year.": "audio/cau/93e220e8766f6d22.mp3", "We were travelling in Sa Pa when it started to rain.": "audio/cau/24e5da22d18fc04f.mp3", "Travelling helps us learn about new places.": "audio/cau/949a1cf0c4bf897c.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City has some underground metro stations.": "audio/cau/fd268956dce8144e.mp3", "We took the underground to the city centre.": "audio/cau/8022bdb95be3059a.mp3", "People are unhappy with the traffic jams.": "audio/cau/8f666d0d974f8f0e.mp3", "Lan was unhappy yesterday, but today she is happy.": "audio/cau/79b51e0a7de4a479.mp3", "Eating fast food every day is unhealthy.": "audio/cau/40ffaf69ed1625bc.mp3", "Minh wants to give up his unhealthy habits.": "audio/cau/6ca9008a431e83bf.mp3", "Today we are reviewing Unit 2.": "audio/cau/4cbb6e6ec2608275.mp3", "This unit is about houses, and the next unit is about friends.": "audio/cau/654b123e0b65a71f.mp3", "Nam grew up in a small village.": "audio/cau/40830ead9e37bc73.mp3", "Lan walked up the hill and then came down.": "audio/cau/815acf6571d188ca.mp3", "The app updates the bus times every minute.": "audio/cau/48150fe27b2aeaac.mp3", "Mi checks the traffic updates before she goes to school.": "audio/cau/b35c6d90cf0ec22a.mp3", "We use computers to make our visual story.": "audio/cau/1f9e65093a2c0cf1.mp3", "This app is very useful, and I use it every day.": "audio/cau/7434eb2ec1577d85.mp3", "This dictionary is very useful.": "audio/cau/d616d82dd437efdf.mp3", "A computer is useful, but a broken one is useless.": "audio/cau/061aada006d6e574.mp3", "She is using a computer to write her story.": "audio/cau/c0867dfe4d3cf7aa.mp3", "Minh used a map yesterday, and today he is using his phone.": "audio/cau/2f51e71c740b9c6e.mp3", "I usually get up at six o'clock.": "audio/cau/56d7578c4454be93.mp3", "Mi usually walks to school, so it is unusual for her to be late.": "audio/cau/3e33c944667515e1.mp3", "My school is very big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/5cd4ea7091dbf666.mp3", "Thank you very much for your help.": "audio/cau/162955bdaf4118ee.mp3", "My grandparents live in a small village.": "audio/cau/959ff3761670ea0d.mp3", "The villagers in our village grow rice.": "audio/cau/c5c92b3fc554d83c.mp3", "I walk to school every day.": "audio/cau/0a109a8251b16954.mp3", "Mi walked in the park and enjoyed her walk.": "audio/cau/f2ec11ed20a260e3.mp3", "I want to go to the summer camp.": "audio/cau/16ac9d133b953dea.mp3", "Minh wanted a new bike, and he still wants one.": "audio/cau/74bcc5e39e26178a.mp3", "Mi wants to live in a big city.": "audio/cau/8d3e0f754ef95b04.mp3", "Nam wants to be a doctor because he wants to help people.": "audio/cau/c9ea53f361e19fe4.mp3", "Nam was at home yesterday.": "audio/cau/faca1649a4ef8a76.mp3", "I was tired, but my friends were happy.": "audio/cau/e3e7c2c50296c48e.mp3", "The city has a big problem with waste.": "audio/cau/6899180825d3dc6f.mp3", "Don't waste water, because wasting water is wasteful.": "audio/cau/0b423194bddcb318.mp3", "This is the best way to learn new words.": "audio/cau/22b4d6bd5dcffca6.mp3", "Can you show me the way to the museum?": "audio/cau/a9eaac6ad2044743.mp3", "There are many ways to stay healthy.": "audio/cau/f79f902892e98e97.mp3", "Walking is a good way to keep fit.": "audio/cau/93a24eae327f3cdd.mp3", "Lan sings very well.": "audio/cau/8d831f0b90fa91ed.mp3", "Nam plays football well, but Phong plays better.": "audio/cau/7c13b2c077241009.mp3", "We went to the summer camp last June.": "audio/cau/577b7f143e454603.mp3", "Mi usually goes by bus, but yesterday she went by bike.": "audio/cau/bf4b0b541f770b47.mp3", "They were in Ha Noi last year.": "audio/cau/a884324b521a97cd.mp3", "I was at school, and my parents were at work.": "audio/cau/d6c97d0e9f2b3c05.mp3", "Where do you live, Lan?": "audio/cau/0c6d7d3df1a25694.mp3", "Where is my schoolbag, Mum?": "audio/cau/57a3c3d221996a0d.mp3", "Tuan tells a joke and the whole class laughs.": "audio/cau/72200be54ac56f1e.mp3", "We cleaned the whole house in one day.": "audio/cau/9e8c820037d2934c.mp3", "Why do you like this book?": "audio/cau/f853b0b3138e4625.mp3", "'Why are you late?' 'Because I missed the bus.'": "audio/cau/c4cf7bd9b30f00fd.mp3", "My parents work in a hospital in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/4a34bda1f13dc400.mp3", "My uncle is a hard-working worker; he works every day.": "audio/cau/4fe31bc354d9e0c5.mp3", "The worker wears a helmet.": "audio/cau/9c235c7e97cd46ce.mp3", "Factory workers work long hours.": "audio/cau/dd3d0d4cd13eb0b4.mp3", "My mum is working in the garden now.": "audio/cau/0fc0a939dbaf61f1.mp3", "Dad works hard, and today he is working late.": "audio/cau/8fff1884b3def435.mp3", "Would you like to live here?": "audio/cau/648fc211b3b7e91a.mp3", "I would like a villa with a big garden.": "audio/cau/af8db0397bcb6281.mp3", "Please write your name here.": "audio/cau/a728b2e865ff5c76.mp3", "Mi likes to write, and she wrote a story yesterday.": "audio/cau/a907f42938059961.mp3", "My aunt is a writer.": "audio/cau/0b898dc7eb5824c9.mp3", "Mi wants to be a writer because she loves to write stories.": "audio/cau/5ce118b1d0da266b.mp3", "She was writing a book when I phoned her.": "audio/cau/97a3ce971a3a7562.mp3", "Mi is writing a letter, and she wrote one yesterday too.": "audio/cau/f5189e5fac049044.mp3"};
